  {"clause_id": "c015", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The Materials are disclaimed as \"experimental in nature\" and given with no warranty of fitness, yet Section 3 authorizes their use to make a GMP clinical vector for dosing patients in a Phase I trial. Whether the blanket disclaimer survives that expressly contemplated clinical application is a question only the two provisions together raise.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.14}
