  {"clause_id": "c022", "issues": [
    {"issue": "The duty to \"immediately cease use\" and \"return all Materials and progeny\" cannot readily be squared with Section 3, which authorizes Recipient to consume the Materials in manufacturing a GMP lentiviral vector and to dose patients in a Phase I trial. What must be returned once the Materials have been incorporated into a clinical product is unresolved between the two provisions.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.26}
